  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Djigbode Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will enable DJIGBODE to improve and expand their cassava processing and storage capabilities. The project will strengthen the groups production and organizational capacity. Production will be increase through training in improved production techniques and provision of appropriate processing equipment and facilities to ensure the womens safety as well as compliance with health and sanitation regulations. The womens management skills will be improved through training in business and financial management, cooperative life, and a strong emphasis on literacy and numeracy to enable the women to track their own production, take ownership of their activities, and make calculations to inform their day to day decisions</narrative>
  </description>
